<title>SWITZERLAND: Metro to get 5.05 pct of Prodega.</title>
<headline>Metro to get 5.05 pct of Prodega.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prodega AG, owner of a retail cash and carry store chain, said it is expanding its cooperation with retailer Metro Group in a move which calls for Metro to take a 5.05 percent stake in Prodega.</p>
<p>Curti+Co AG, Prodega's majority shareholder, will continue to hold a 53 percent stake in Prodega's registered shares, the company said. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
